y":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"g1rVS1nWYo3BFd0rhzWHNg","review_id":"apX9x1uonfGE5Za4TYSgjQ","date":"2012-01-25T15:59:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9149973392486572,"text_excerpt":"Another solid King Cake bakery. I haven't been to the actual store. Their cakes are at various locations around the city. A coworker brought this one today. We had the pecan praline version which was more of a topping then a filling. The pecan praline was tasty without being too sweet (emphasis on pecan rather than praline which I appreciated). I did have to dump off some of the icing. That was a little too sweet for me first thing in the morning. Tasty."},{"business_id":"g1rVS1nWYo3BFd0rhzWHNg","review_id":"DKawdFaSu9CDnMURhVmK8w","date":"2019-03-05T04:33:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9071216583251953,"text_excerpt":"I recently stumbled upon a top king cake list and I saw a picture of the king cake that was from La Louisiane bakery. Right away, I loved how fluffy the king cake looked compared to this flat one that someone had bought me from Randazzo's. I cut it open and I fell in love with how soft, moist, and fluffy it was. The box said that it used a traditional brioche dough. My favorite part is how this king cake is not smothered in cinnamon where it is so overpowering it dries your mouth out. Yum!"},{"business_id":"g1rVS1nWYo3BFd0rhzWHNg","review_id":"vwE5QWiDDc77C_i_v_4MrQ","date":"2020-12-05T07:59:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9051056504249573,"text_excerpt":"Though they might not get all the press, I write with confidence knowing that La Louisiane is an outstanding bakery in the New Orleans area. Located in a semi-sleepy warehouse'y area of Elmswood, they manage to crank out delicious baked goods daily and have made a name for themselves through local catering. While they bake a number of things, I think it's safe to say cakes are their most popular item. They make really awesome wedding cakes, sheet cakes, cupcakes, and a really stellar king cake. The latter is available year round, which is really convenient. The doberge cake is perfect for chocolate lovers and the NOLA wedding cake is decadent. A lot of people sleep on their ooey gooey cak..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"g1rVS1nWYo3BFd0rhzWHNg","photo_id":"tYZtb-omW-ghca-CdJAK5Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/tYZtb-omW-ghca-CdJAK5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.935125470161438},{"business_id":"g1rVS1nWYo3BFd0rhzWHNg","photo_id":"LvBDCZbzQ2I85FTzi9pPGw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LvBDCZbzQ2I85FTzi9pPGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8455460071563721},{"business_id":"g1rVS1nWYo3BFd0rhzWHNg","photo_id":"ILac4xIhoZlYThtVi6OgyA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ILac4xIhoZlYThtVi6OgyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8245764374732971}]},"notebook_case":null}
